    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aba Desalonike",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghang'eatng'eat gaweay nea gwasik ng'eanyiida Amfipoli ea Apoloniya, ghwahita ng'eanyiida Desalonike, mida ghooriida siinealshacheewa bea fuga Yahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa Bawlo jeeda ghooriida, gawuurji gideaba eawoojisu bea gealaan, ak gwasheang'dooschi sea buuneeda aba ng'asheega Ng'ooruutka Ghaydit eawooji diktam ea agi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gwarukusa buuneeda gidanyaah ng'ooruutka bea gideaba Gristo gayghwanyas hang'weaniidooda ak gwaduuna miyeeda, ak gabiikta gwayeesha, “Yesuheeni ghamneawa earukuneegwean, Gristo gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iidu ghamwas fuga mwaatkwa ak ghwaat geeshta Bawlo ea Sila; ak eara fuga saang'a bea Yunani awali gheang'da ASEETA ea gadeemga saang'a was fuga hees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwashissa ghaang' fuga Yahudi, ak gaweay ghamwaghaada fuga munyas seara saang'a aba jeeda mujiini ak gooyuuk buuneeda, hean geeng'eessa gheeh Yasoni, nea geegasa eeruudu jarooda ak geayaat madeeda buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama iidu nea mudu eanyas, hean geengiir Yasoni eayaat sea fiisu ng'ay siduupcheewi ak geayaat ea eehita madeeda sugoodiga mujiini, nea geechuur nea geeyi, “Fiisu yam ng'eanyiidean nupka eara hiji, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak Yasoni ea nideapta fiisu; ak fiisu seaniin eanisin ng'asheanda meateayi sea diigheanda sugoocheanda siguura Gaysari, nea gwayi, gwanda sugoocheanda nuut siguura Yesu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwahirbaban sugoodiga ambal mujiini iiyiy ng'asheanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu geeyaaga ghoorjooda Yasoni ea fugaaschi, amahit geesiksa gaweay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aba Beroya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deagheata goojeakta fuga siduupcheewi Bawlo ea Sila eawa gaweay Beroya; hean hita hooweani geeweay jeeda ghooriida siinealshacheewa bea fuga Yahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fugeaba ng'eanyiita gooleehiidiit muuchi mawuurji fuga ng'eanyiida Desalonike, aba gideaba ghwadeapta ng'asheanda aba hooseaneega, ak gwasikiideawa ng'ooruutka ghaydidi galeagasean ghwadaah gideaba ng'asheega huumwa gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamwas fuga saang'a, aba jeedeaba fiisu eara gadeemga mii ng'ay was fuga hees bea fuga Yunani ea headiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy fuga Yahudi bea ng'eanyiida Desalonike gideaba Bawlo gwarukwiida ng'asheega ASEETA eara aba ng'eanyiida Beroya, geeweay ama sihita geeyuuk buuneeda nea geang'uda foolayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deagheata goojeakta fuga siduupcheewi Bawlo gawa ng'eanyiida ghuuta basooda nea Sila ea Dimoteo saawa goobiida hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu fugiga ghwanyawa adoabiiw Bawlohiin ghwaat ea ghoahiita Atene; hean ghwanung' eeyeasa Sila ea Dimoteo, gideaba abean alamwajaana hean ghang'eatng'eat gaweay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aba Atene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damani amuukghna Bawlo saawa aba Atenehiin, abeeda ea ninyareas muuchi aba gideaba ghwadaah mujiineedida nea saang'a duguuga sinung' ghoah aseecheeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damani mideawa jeeda ghooriida siinealshacheewean hean gwasheang'nyi sea fuga Yahudi ea Eemoojiga suurja awali gheang'da ASEETA, ea fuga naadi galeagasean ea fuga mida hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwaroonyi sea fuga siguura Epikureo ea Stoiki mideawa fughareenga. Hean gwayeesha fuga mwaatkwa, “Siisi ajuuriin gagasa gwayiin?” Gwayi mwaatkwa, “Iising'ulayi ea rabascheanda rukwiida giijasta aseecheeka meanala”, aba gideaba gwaruku ng'asheega Yesu ea ng'asheega duunooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geang'waay amahit geayaat heeda Areyopago, ak geeyeesha, “Geegasayi eanala gidawas giinealshooni eesh gwachi igooniin? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ng'asheesu iyeaduun aba iidigaasa gidabunu gil; asi geegasayi eanala deayeegeaba ng'asheesu gidawas.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga ng'eanyiida Atene ea rabasta abiita hoowa ea mandeawana gheata jea gwasina gil nuut geaghus rukwiideayda ng'asheega ea giileeysiindeaba iit bea ng'asheega bunu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinaada Bawlo aba madeeda eemeeda mida hiji siguura Areopagohiin ak gwayeesha, “Ea fuga ng'eanyiida Atene ghaadaayi gideaba agooga ghoabwariinyi muuchi ng'asheega diini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damanda aang'ataawi, ghaadaayi haleanjeedeang'wa bea ghadooweeda, ghaadaayi aba heeda wagiida heeda sing'oorsa ng'asheesu, ‘Heeda aseeta meadaaha.’ Siida oobadayi nea moanaliin, dea earukuneegwa iitaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ASEETA ghayi bwat muunda ng'eanyiida ea haleanjeeda sean, niny Ng'utamiida humng'eeda gil ea ng'eanyiida, niny moobiiteena jeeda gealga sibata ASEETA sideasa geatinga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak niny ea moamu geatinga buuneeda gagadiiyeesa, gawuurji gili niny gasa gil, dea goona eaweega gil, ak ghoadaw buuneeda giisiimeanda ea haleanjeeda sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin niny aba siyagi eemoojiga sean was buuneeda ak ghwanung' goobiida badayda ng'eanyiida, ama ng'ata nea niidaw damanyoojiga ghayi bay gwarukuta niny, ea moonghajeega giibinda nyaawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda gagasa ASEETA earapeadi rar gideaba eara ghanyi ghawaas niny ak ghwanyas niny. Nea niny ea mii sheageewa siida wassean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
